{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/019-yin-qi-lei/maruichen-tongshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/019-yin-qi-lei/maruichen-tongshi/data.json","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋 · 殷其靁 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 殷其靁 · 汇集《毛詩傳箋通釋》关于《殷其靁》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"019-yin-qi-lei","materialId":"maruichen-tongshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/019-yin-qi-lei/maruichen-tongshi","poem":{"id":"019-yin-qi-lei","title":"殷其靁","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","殷其靁"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"殷其靁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"在南山之陽","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"何斯違斯","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"莫敢或遑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"振振君子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"歸哉歸哉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"殷其靁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"在南山之側","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"何斯違斯","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"莫敢遑息","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"振振君子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"歸哉歸哉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"殷其靁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"在南山之下","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"何斯違斯","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"莫或遑處","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"振振君子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"歸哉歸哉","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"maruichen-tongshi","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋","authors":["馬瑞辰"],"contributorLine":"清 · 馬瑞辰","era":"清","publicationYear":1989,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"殷其靁，在南山之陽。何斯違斯？莫敢或遑。振振君子，歸哉歸哉。殷其靁，在南山之側。何斯違斯？莫敢遑息。振振君子，歸哉歸哉。殷其靁，在南山之下。何斯違斯？莫或遑處。振振君子，歸哉歸哉。","targetNotes":"整篇按语与名义考。","sourceLabel":"第 90-91 页","sourceNotes":"依据 /tmp/yin-qi-lei-maruichen/p122.png 与 /tmp/yin-qi-lei-maruichen/p123.png 中《殷其靁》条。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"马瑞辰","sectionLabel":"按","text":"瑞辰先从字义与通假说起，申明“殷”就雷声盛大而言，并以山南、山侧、山下三句写雷势由高而下。至“何斯違斯，莫敢或遑”以下，则仍从《序》义解释为大夫妻子思念从政君子，知其王事奔走、无暇宁息，故虽言“歸哉歸哉”，其实是反覆申说未可遽归，而在闵劳中寓劝勉。","notes":null}]}]}}}
